  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Objektif finansman : pou anonse.",
  "why.kickstarterRoadmapPhase": "Kickstarter la (faz 5 plan wout la) se premye tou ranmasaj lajan piblik. Lajan li an dwe anboche premye devlopè ak designè grafik ki pèdi travay akoz IA (faz 6), ki answit ranplase resous fèt pa IA yo youn pa youn. <0>Sa premye tou a peye, wòl pa wòl : pou anonse.<\/0>",
